    holon:hasContextGraph <https://example.org/openevidence/questions/q_peptic_ulcer_disease_efficacy-con> .

<https://example.org/openevidence/drugs/omeprazole> oe:treats <https://example.org/openevidence/diseases/peptic_ulcer_disease> .
